# ==============================================================================
**/artifacts/last_model.pth
**/artifacts/best_model_flagship.pth
**/artifacts/best_model_pre_step2.pth
**/artifacts/best_model_swin_384.pth
**/artifacts/best_model_22class.pth
**/artifacts/best_model_31class.pth

